WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
- I heard this crazy story.

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.910
It's random and I have
to know if it's true.

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:06.210
Did you accidentally break
a First Lady's ankle?

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:10.110
And how does that happen, if so?

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.080
- Well, George Bush invited me

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.070
when I was the Chairman

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.140
of the President's Council on Fitness.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.120
He would invite me always to Camp David.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.710
This was 1991-92 when he was president.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.950
He would invite me up there,
literally like every month.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.770
He loved hanging out with
me and working out with me.

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:32.790
We do throwing horseshoe
and going running up there

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:33.750
and all this stuff.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:37.050
And I was one time up there in the winter.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:40.080
And so, he said to me, he
says, "I have this great sled,"

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.040
which was not really a
sled, it was a toboggan.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.050
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.350
- And so with sleds,
you can steer the sled

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.540
with your feet.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.190
But that one I couldn't really steer.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:53.250
So, we go down the hill in the snow there.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.860
He's sitting behind me
and he says, "You steer."

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.954
And I did not know how to steer.

00:00:57.954 --> 00:01:00.540
So, I mean, just going faster and faster

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.580
and all of a sudden, we're
approaching this tree

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:05.160
and all of a sudden Barbara
comes up behind the tree

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.144
and then we just ran into her leg.

00:01:08.144 --> 00:01:11.070
And so, poor Barbara Bush,

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.470
she was like, she had to go
to the hospital afterwards.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:14.303
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:14.303 --> 00:01:17.280
- She had a sprained leg
and she got a cast on it

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.210
and the whole thing like that.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:21.600
But I have to say that they
were very gracious about it

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.060
and the way that they took it.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:27.060
And I apologized.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:28.530
I said, "I feel really bad."

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:29.910
- [Kelly] Nobody has this story.

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:31.410
That's incredible.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:33.570
- [Arnold] She was a wonderful First Lady.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:34.403
- Wow.

